  "scope": "The actual ordered demand scan invokes the real original-cost retained-matrix and zero-cost path machine on each visited original demand. The literal first successful original occurrence and path are returned, or absence is allocated. Its result exactly matches original findAvoiding; its own physical terminal-inclusive bound sums original input sizes. Zero masks are recomputed per visited demand, without claiming equality to the original logical operation counter. Initial representations and widths, full outer dispatch and whole paper runtime remain separate."
